flowchart TD
    Client([Client / Swagger UI])
    Client --> API["FastAPI checkout endpoints<br/>/checkout/pessimistic, /checkout/optimistic, /checkout/redis"]

    API -->|redis strategy| RedisDecr["Redis atomic DECR<br/>(fast path, no Postgres round-trip)"]
    RedisDecr -->|remaining < 0| RedisReject["INCR compensate -> 409 Sold out"]
    RedisDecr -->|stock available| PgInsertRedis["Postgres: INSERT order<br/>(source of truth)"]
    PgInsertRedis -.->|insert fails| RedisCompensate["INCR compensate Redis counter"]

    API -->|pessimistic strategy| PgLocked["Postgres: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE<br/>on Inventory row, then UPDATE + INSERT"]
    API -->|optimistic strategy| PgOcc["Postgres: UPDATE Inventory<br/>WHERE version = read_version (OCC)"]

    PgInsertRedis --> OrdersTbl[("orders / inventory tables")]
    PgLocked --> OrdersTbl
    PgOcc --> OrdersTbl

    API --> BehaviorLog["log_checkout_attempt()<br/>writes UserBehaviorLog on its own connection<br/>(every attempt: confirmed, rejected, or errored)"]
    BehaviorLog --> BehaviorTbl[("user_behavior_logs")]

    BehaviorTbl --> BatchJob["scripts/run_bot_scoring.py<br/>(explicit batch job)"]
    BatchJob --> BotModel["bot_detection.score_sessions()<br/>Isolation Forest over checkout_latency,<br/>session_duration, accounts_per_device,<br/>requests_per_ip_per_min"]
    BotModel --> FlaggedTbl["writes FlaggedOrder row +<br/>flips Order.status = 'flagged'"]
    FlaggedTbl --> FlaggedAPI["GET /flagged-orders"]

    OrdersTbl --> HistData["Historical order volume +<br/>data/online_retail.xlsx (UCI Online Retail)"]
    HistData --> DemandModel["demand_forecast.py<br/>GradientBoostingRegressor<br/>predicts next-period SKU demand"]
    DemandModel --> SafetyStock["Safety-stock / concurrency-strategy decision"]
    SafetyStock -->|high predicted volume: use pessimistic locking| API
    SafetyStock -->|low predicted volume: use OCC| API
